_17572_1003.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\"><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010'>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:#b22222;\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com'>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"admin@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","GroupId":4,"GroupName":"Administrators","JoinDate":1137209820,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TammyWright","Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76429,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1393008266,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"09eac2fd60137fde3434fda72cedc3a6","RawContent":"&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:rgb(24,24,24);background-color:rgb(253,252,250);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;Hello BDW Brides &amp;amp; Grooms,&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:rgb(24,24,24);background-color:rgb(253,252,250);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:rgb(24,24,24);background-color:rgb(253,252,250);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;BestDestinationWedding.com &amp;amp; Wright Travel Agency are excited to present a wedding webinar for NOW Jade &amp;amp; NOW Sapphire.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:rgb(24,24,24);background-color:rgb(253,252,250);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:rgb(24,24,24);background-color:rgb(253,252,250);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial, sans, sans-serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);\"&gt;Isela Juarez- wedding coordinator for NOW Jade and Anel Torres from NOW Sapphire&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;, will be panelists and will give a presentation as well as be on hand for a Q &amp;amp; A session.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:rgb(24,24,24);background-color:rgb(253,252,250);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:rgb(24,24,24);background-color:rgb(253,252,250);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;We will also have a travel agent as a panelist to answer your travel questions about rates, group blocks vs. individual packages, etc.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:rgb(24,24,24);background-color:rgb(253,252,250);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:rgb(24,24,24);background-color:rgb(253,252,250);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;This is a great opportunity for current&amp;nbsp;NOW Jade and NOW Sapphire brides and grooms or those considering the venues for the wedding location to get your questions answered.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:rgb(24,24,24);background-color:rgb(253,252,250);\"&gt;--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:rgb(24,24,24);background-color:rgb(253,252,250);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NOW Resorts Wedding Webinar&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;Join us for a Webinar on March 22&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Space is limited.&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reserve your Webinar seat now at:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www1.gotomeeting.com\/register\/515843609&#039;&gt;https:\/\/www1.gotomeeting.com\/register\/515843609&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;Join us for a wedding webinar for NOW Resorts. &amp;nbsp;We will cover how to plan your wedding at NOW Resorts and your best travel options as well hold a Q &amp;amp; A Session at the end of the presentations.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Title:&lt;span&gt; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;NOW Resorts Wedding Webinar&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Date:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;\/span&gt;Saturday, March 22, 2014&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time:&lt;span&gt; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;9:00 AM - 11:59 AM PDT&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;After registering you will receive a confirmation email containing information about joining the Webinar.&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;System Requirements&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;PC-based attendees&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Required: Windows\u00ae 8, 7, Vista, XP or 2003 Server&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Mac\u00ae-based attendees&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Required: Mac OS\u00ae X 10.6 or newer&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Mobile attendees&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Required: iPhone\u00ae, iPad\u00ae, Android\u2122 phone or Android tablet&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1835024,"PostDate":1392998799,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:rgb(24,24,24);background-color:rgb(253,252,250)\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">Hello BDW Brides & Grooms,<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:rgb(24,24,24);background-color:rgb(253,252,250)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:rgb(24,24,24);background-color:rgb(253,252,250)\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">BestDestinationWedding.com & Wright Travel Agency are excited to present a wedding webinar for NOW Jade & NOW Sapphire.<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:rgb(24,24,24);background-color:rgb(253,252,250)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:rgb(24,24,24);background-color:rgb(253,252,250)\"><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial, sans, sans-serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">Isela Juarez- wedding coordinator for NOW Jade and Anel Torres from NOW Sapphire<\/span><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">, will be panelists and will give a presentation as well as be on hand for a Q & A session.<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:rgb(24,24,24);background-color:rgb(253,252,250)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:rgb(24,24,24);background-color:rgb(253,252,250)\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">We will also have a travel agent as a panelist to answer your travel questions about rates, group blocks vs. individual packages, etc.<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:rgb(24,24,24);background-color:rgb(253,252,250)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:rgb(24,24,24);background-color:rgb(253,252,250)\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">This is a great opportunity for current\u00a0NOW Jade and NOW Sapphire brides and grooms or those considering the venues for the wedding location to get your questions answered.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:rgb(24,24,24);background-color:rgb(253,252,250)\">--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:rgb(24,24,24);background-color:rgb(253,252,250)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>NOW Resorts Wedding Webinar<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:18px\">Join us for a Webinar on March 22<\/span><\/span><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Space is limited.<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/div>\n<div><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Reserve your Webinar seat now at:<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/div>\n<div><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href='https:\/\/www1.gotomeeting.com\/register\/515843609' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www1.gotomee...ister\/515843609<\/a><\/span><\/span><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:18px\">Join us for a wedding webinar for NOW Resorts. \u00a0We will cover how to plan your wedding at NOW Resorts and your best travel options as well hold a Q & A Session at the end of the presentations.<\/span><\/span><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Title:<span> <\/span><\/strong>NOW Resorts Wedding Webinar<\/span><\/span><\/div>\n<div><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Date:<\/strong><span> <\/span>Saturday, March 22, 2014<\/span><\/span><\/div>\n<div><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Time:<span> <\/span><\/strong>9:00 AM - 11:59 AM PDT<\/span><\/span><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>After registering you will receive a confirmation email containing information about joining the Webinar.<\/div>\n<div>System Requirements<\/div>\n<div>PC-based attendees<\/div>\n<div>Required: Windows\u00ae 8, 7, Vista, XP or 2003 Server<\/div>\n<div>Mac\u00ae-based attendees<\/div>\n<div>Required: Mac OS\u00ae X 10.6 or newer<\/div>\n<div>Mobile attendees<\/div>\n<div>Required: iPhone\u00ae, iPad\u00ae, Android\u2122 phone or Android tablet<\/div>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Founder and Owner of BestDestinationWedding.com \u00a0\/ \u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78931-bride-and-groom-fly-free-20152016\/'><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Bride & Groom Fly FREE Promotion<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/go\/destination-wedding\/?source=EMLSIG'><strong><span style=\"color:#008080;\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings-CLICK HERE<\/span><\/strong><\/a><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>?<\/strong> \u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/span><\/a><\/strong><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif